Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dayana2@gmail.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. Iniciar sesión con clave errónea (Error - 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dayana2@gmail.com",
  "password": "clave_incorrecta"
}